<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Ghalasi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl nakwyal bot ɛ kyee dik Ghalasi ɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ghalasi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gha</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl nakwyal bot ɛ kyee dik</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ghalasi ɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl nakwyal étɛp bot ɛ Ghalasi ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala di pɛ ɛko ɛ bɔs kyee dik di djóoaa mos Tuulki ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:14">Mɛs 13.14</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl nakwyal mɛkana mak ɛ́, étɛp ɛdul bot ɛ nazedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ mɛlɔ náá, ye tok ɛni ɛ beka di esa náá, bɛ di bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nyɛ eebasal náá, yɛ ɛ́ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ Yezu kɔ mɛlaaba ɛ́ di esa náá, menabɛl bot ɛ mesyem bela tsik.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak ɛ́ nɛ mɛtyek mɛtɛn nɛ ebá:</para>
  <para style="io1">Mɛswosel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-5">1.1-5</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">sim Mbɛɛ Bhaadal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:6-10">1.6-10</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">Pɔl ɛpekaada bot tsik'ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:11-2:14">1.11–2.14</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ, mot di ebela tsik (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:15-5:1">2.15–5.1</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">Zɛɛb eesa náá, mena nàdika ekwom (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 5:2-12">5.2-12</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">Sisim nɛ epuud (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 5:13-26">5.13-26</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">ɛkwyeel pak'en, nɛ ɛsael mɛsa pak'en (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 6:1-10">6.1-10</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">Pɔl silal mɛkana mɛ ɛ́, nɛ ɛdul ɛ bot mɛlɔ nɛ mɛswosel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6.11-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam Pɔl, mot-lwoma ɛ Klisto. Ye tok bot nasa náá, mɛ di mot-lwoma ɛ Klisto, ààkobɛ-bɛak ɛkwosak ɛ mot. Tin, yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Yezu Klisto nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg, mot nagomal nyɛ bhis ɛsyee ɔ, mɛ di mos mot-lwoma. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Bis nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bam djas di wak ɛ, bis eesɛɛgaa étɛp ɛkwyal mɛkana mak nɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala kyee dik Ghalasi. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Beta náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto djɛ bin enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ egwyem bɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Klisto naaka nyel'ɛ met buwa, étɛp ɛtsik ɛ mena tɔ mesyem. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp nyɛ neepɛk mena tɔ mbee tsik bɔs'ak. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́ nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Duu nɛ Zɛɛb, kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>!<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sim Mbɛɛ Bhaadal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Mɛ ɛpedjoka nɛ dáa bi zeleelum Zɛɛb mot nazedjóo bin kɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ɛ Klisto ɔ koŋ ɛ. Étɛp ɛdu dhiiti mbi mɛlyo mɛ bɛdhiiti bot di eke náá, yɛ ɛ́ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Deenek, ye tok nɛ dhiiti mbi Mbɛɛ Bhaadal! Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di ezɛm bin, bɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ ɛswoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Tin, ye nakoozodi bisɔ bɛmet, nɛghu fofop dus tɔ gwoo ɔ, mot ɛ zyɛ zɛgoola bin dhiiti Mbɛɛ Bhaadal di ààbɛ tyee wat nɛ yii bis nagoola bin ɔ, mot tak bela mbee baka! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Bis eezelɛɛ yɛ, mɛ ɛpebaabasal bin yɛ nenak. Mot ɛ zɛgoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal sis di ààbɛ tyee wat nɛ yii bi nazegwak ɔ, mot tak goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbela mbee baka. <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />É di'enek, mɛ ààsaa náá, bot myaala nɛ nam, mɛ saŋ ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb myaala nɛ nam. Mɛ ààkwyɛl náá, bot myaala nɛ nam. Mɛ ɛpedi ɛ́ di ekwyɛl náá, bot myaala nɛ nam ɔɔ, pe mɛ tok mot-mɛsa ɛ Klisto.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl nazɛdi mot-lwoma dáa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ goola bin ɛ, ye tok esua-esua yii mot zesu ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Etɛɛ náá, ye tok mot nadjɛ mɛ yɛ, nɛghu ɛlyaal mɛ yɛ, deenek, yɛ ɛ́ Yezu Klisto ɛ natel mɛ.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak mɛfulu mɛ mɛ nadi nɛ yɛ, é sok mɛ nadi mɛ dinaa mot zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɔ. Bi nɛ gu dáa mɛ nadi ewa bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ Zɛɛb tɔ tsik mezuk, nɛ ɛwa zii étɛp ɛwaaz yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />É sok mɛ nadi tɔ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɛ, mɛ naadhaa bɛtɛ nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bam eYuda yii kɔkɔ membu mam nɛ zii ɛduwal ɛ etsi e bɛbhaab bis.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Tin, Zɛɛb naaloozesɛ́ɛ mɛ tɔ mɔ nyaagam, ɛsok nɛ mɛ nɛ byel, nyɛ naadjóo mɛ tɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ. É ɛwala ɛ nyɛ nakwos ɛ, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />nyɛ eelyaal mɛ Mɔn'ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ neekɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Tin, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkɛsaa mɛlyo pɛ daa mot. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Bela náá, mɛ ààpatɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, pɛ daa bot ɛ nadi bot ɛ lwoma ɛsok nɛ nam ɔ. Mɛ natɔ́ ɛ́ pɛ kyee dik Aalabi, bhii tak mɛ eezɛsik pɛ ghaada Dhamas. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Membu melɛl bhii tak, mɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, étɛp ɛkɛboma nɛ Pyɛɛd, tin, mɛ eezɛdi mɛlu kam nɛ etɛn bis nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààboma nɛ dhiiti mot-lwoma sis, bhii Zak mɔn-nyɛɛg ɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Etɛp ee mɛ di ekwyal bin wak ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ etɛp etsɛɛtsɛ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb, mɛ ààpakɔɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee mɛdhik mɛ Siili nɛ Silisi. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ Klisto di pɛ kyee dik Yude ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ dinaa ààgu ɛbhwoob ɛ lam. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Bɛ nazogwak ɛ́ bot eke náá: «Mot nadi ewaka mena tɔ tsik mezuk kpaambel ɔ, nyɛ moo mos ɛ́ egoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, yii nyɛ nadi ewa zii étɛp ɛwaaz ɛ.» <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Tin, bɛ nadi eduwal Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ lwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Bhii tak, ye naazɛkpaa membu kam nɛ ená. Wɔ gwaa, mɛ baazɛsik pɛ Yeluzalɛm, bis nɛ Bhaanabhas zɛnɔɔ Tit. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Mɛ nasik penek ɛ́ étɛp ɛlooba nɛ sa Zɛɛb natel mɛ ɛ. Tin, bis naazɛboma bis nɛ bot ɛ nadi ebeeaa dáa bot ɛ duu ɔ é kwan. Mɛ naakaada bɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ nadi egoola nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi ekwyɛl náá, mɛsa mɛ mɛ nazesa ɛ, nɛghu mɛsa mɛ mɛ aasa ɛ, di yii toto. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Tin, Tit mot bis nɛ nɛ nadi egyee ɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mot mbyak eGhɛlɛk, mot ngɔt nabɛ ɛ́ ààbesal nyɛ náá, nyɛ ni beka. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Bela náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhiiti bɔn-nyɛɛg bis, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko bhimis pɛ si nazesyela pak'es étɛp ɛsaŋ ɛ́ ɛniigal nyɛ beka ɔ. Bot binɔk nasyela tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ les ɛ, étɛp bɛ neebee dáa bis di ekɛ pɛka tɔ ekwom e tsi ɛ, nɛ dáa di náá bis moo ɛ́ mot ngɔt nɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ. Tin, bɛ nadi ekwyɛl náá, bis di ekwom e tsi. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Tin, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààkoobet-betak náá, ɛkwosak ɛ bot ɛ tak sael, etɛɛ náá, etsɛɛtsɛ e Mbɛɛ Bhaadal needi nɛ nen.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Tin, yɛ kabɛ bot ɛ nadi ebeeaa dáa bot ɛ duu ɔɔ, etɛp bɔɔ ààgwyák mam, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ààsa mbɛk pak bot. Ekukuma binɔk nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi ebe mɛ nɛ bhel náá, mɛ swoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ di egoola ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Ghuna, bɛ naabee náá, Zɛɛb naadjɛ mɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ nadi ààni beka ɔ, dhatyee nyɛ nabaadjɛ Pyɛɛd mɛsa mɛ ɛkɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ nani beka ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Tin, dáa Zɛɛb sa náá, Pyɛɛd di mot-lwoma étɛp bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, nyɛ nabaasa ɛ́ náá, mam di mot-lwoma étɛp bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Dáa bɛ nabee ɛkɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ mɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa Zak, Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ bot ɛ nadi dhatyee ɛgwiŋ ɛ sɛɛg yii zɛɛga mendjaala ɔ, zɛsɛɛb bis nɛ Bhaanabhas mbɔ eghɛŋ bɔɔ. Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ náá, bɛ eemyaal, bis ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ́ katɔ́ pɛ kyee bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, da bɔɔ ɛ́ tɔ́ pɛ kyee bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Tin, bɛ nazoke nɛ nes ɛ́ náá, da bis ɛ́ taala ɛkwyee bɛdjel ɛ bot, ye nabɛ ɛ́, mɛ naasa yɛ nɛ lyem wat.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd pɛ ghaada Antiɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Deenek, dáa Pyɛɛd nazyɛ pɛ Antiɔs ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, mɛ naalii nɛ nɛ ɛbiyoɛpe é mis mɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ ndjɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Tin, ɛsok nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ Zak nalwom ɔ kum, Pyɛɛd nadi edɛ lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bot ɛ nadi ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. É di'enek, dáa bot ɛ tak nakakum ɛ, Pyɛɛd eezɛkyee bot ɛ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ nadi edɛ ɔ, ekaab bot ɛ nazeni beka ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Bɛdhiiti eYuda zokazɛdu embee mɛfulu ɛ Pyɛɛd, tin, wɔ gwaa, ye baazɛsa náá, Bhaanabhas zokabaazɛni tɔ embee mɛsa yii mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Dáa mɛ nabee náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi esa esonok ɛnyɔɛpe dáa etsɛɛtsɛ e Mbɛɛ Bhaadal di elɛɛ ɛ, mɛ ɛ́ boozɛlii nɛ Pyɛɛd é mis mɛ bot náá: «Wɔy mot di mot mbyak eYuda ɔ, wɔ kɛ wak ɛ́ dáa mot di ààdi mot mbyak eYuda ɔ, wɔ ààlooba nɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz. Haaa étɛp yé wɔ di ebesal bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda náá, bɛ du etsi eYuda?»<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsik kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Bisɔ bak, bis ɛ́ mbyela eYuda, bis tok bot ɛ edhiiti membyak di ààduwal etsi e Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Tin, mena nɛ guka náá, mot ààdi mot epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛlooba etsi ɛ Moiiz, yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto. Bisɔ pe, bis naadum koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto, etɛɛ náá, bis needi bot ɛ epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto, ààkabɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz. Deenek, mot aanàdi piki, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eelooba nɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, bisɔ eYuda, bis ɛpesaa ɛdi ɛ́ bot ɛ epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto ɔɔ, ye lyaal ɛ́ náá, bisɔ pe ɛ́ bot ɛ mesyem. Deenek ye kakwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, Yezu Klisto ɛ́ mot-mɛsa mɛ mesyem é? Ààbɛ, ye tok deenek! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Mɛ baabula tɔ ɛduwal ɛ etsi ee mɛ nazebet ɔɔ, deenek, mam ɛmet ɛpelyaal náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot di ààlooba nɛ etsi ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />É di'enek, dum nɛ etsi, mɛ eezegwyɛ, etɛɛ náá, etsi tokapɛ nɛ ghwyil kɔ lam. Djas'enek nasael ɛ́, étɛp mɛ needi nɛ tsik etɛp Zɛɛb. Mɛ eezegwyɛ bis nɛ Yezu Klisto kɔ mɛlaaba. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Deenek, mɛ di nɛ tsik mos ɔɔ, ye tok mam di nɛ tsik, yɛ ɛ́ Yezu Klisto ɛ di nɛ tsik tɔ lam. Etɛɛ náá, tsik mɛ kadi nɛ yɛ mos kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lam nɛ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb, mot nakwyɛl mɛ, da djɛ tsik'ɛ étɛp mɛ neetsak ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Mɛ ààbyen enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb. Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, etsi ɛ Moiiz ɛ di edjɛ epiki tɔ mot ɔɔ, deenek, Yezu Klisto nagwyɛ ɛ́ gwyes.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Etsi nɛghu ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Biyɔ bot ɛ Ghalasi, bi ɛpelyet é! Ɛzɛ zeseeb bin? Bela náá, bɛ nalyaal bin popoopwon dáa Yezu Klisto nabemaa é mɛlaaba ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ ɛdji bin náá: Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛlooba nɛ etsi ɛ bi nabela Sisim na Dɛɛ ohoo, nɛghu yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi naagwak Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, da dum koŋ nɛ yɛ? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Étɛp yé bi di elyet deenek? Sa bi nakan nɛ Sisim Zɛɛb ɛ, bi kakwyɛl ɛsilal yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil epuud é? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Bi zebee mbi yenek etuŋ ɛ́ gwyes é? Deenek, ye tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi yii gwyes. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Zɛɛb mot di edjɛ bin Sisim nɛ ɛbaasa endem e mɛbwala tɔ len ɔ, bi ke ɛ́ náá, nyɛ sa yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ looba nɛ etsi ohoo, nɛghu etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ gwak Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Dáa ye di náá, Abalaam naadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, Zɛɛb naadjɛ nyɛ di epiki. <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Ye goka ɛ́ bi gu náá, yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ di bɛtɛtɛ ɛ bɔn Abalaam. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Ekwyala naaloozelɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadjɛ di epiki nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ nɛ. Deenek, Ekwyala naaloozelɛɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal tak nɛ Abalaam náá: «Bot ɛ membyak djas ɛ́ waasɛɛaa mɛtel kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ.» <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Deenek, Abalaam naadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ naasɛɛaa mɛtel, yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bɛ eesɛɛaa mɛtel dáa Abalaam.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Bot ɛ di ewa lyem tɔ ɛsa sa etsi di elɛɛ ɛ, bɔɔ djas ɛ́ kala. Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Mbee baka nɛ mot di ààlooba nɛ etɛp djas di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɔ.» <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Deenek, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi mot epiki é mis ɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛlooba nɛ etsi. Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Mot di mot epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛy ɛ́ paabela tsik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mena aabaabela yɛ ɛ́ tɔ <char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2.4</ref></char>.</char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Bela náá, ye tok etsi di edjɛ bot ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Ghuna, ye baakwyalel ɛ́ náá: «Mot di ekɛ dáa mɛtiŋ mɛ etsi di elɛɛ ɔ, nyɛ aadi nɛ tsik kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak.»<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Tin, yɛ ɛ́ Klisto ɛ pɛk mena tɔ mbee baka etsi. Nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet naabela baka kɔ ɛsu ɛ lena. Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Mbee baka nɛ mot di egóaa tsela é le ɔ.» <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek, bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, bɛ eebela esɛɛa e mɛtel mɛ nakɛkaa Abalaam kɔ lo ɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ. Tin, yɛ ɛ́ é ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ mena aabela Sisim Zɛɛb nakɛk ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etsi nɛ ekɛk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, gwakeka, mɛ pookonɔɔ bin dhiiti geka tyee bot di ezeezyɛ nɛ ɛsa ɛ: Yɛ bɛ náá, mot eekwyal mɛkana mɛ mɛlik mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, dhiiti mot sis tokapɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛkabaazyɛ zɛdis sonok, nɛghu ɛkɛl dhiiti mɛkpa tɔ tak. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Yɛ ɛ́ dhatyee ekɛk e Zɛɛb pɛ daa Abalaam nɛ dha yɛ. Ekwyala ààlɛɛ náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ bɛdha bɛ», dhatyee náá, ye lii ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛbuɛpe. Tin, ye zolii ɛ́ nɛ mot ngɔt, dáa ye di kwyala ɛ: «Nɛ dha'ɔ.» Dha tak kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Gwakeka sa mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: Mɛkana mɛ mɛlik mɛ Zɛɛb naloozekwyal ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ, ye tokapɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛbaazɛsaabel nɛ etsi di náá, ye nazɛsael ɛ́ bhii membu bɛdhet-ɛná nɛ mɛkam-mɛlɛl (430) ɛ. Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, ekɛk e Zɛɛb aadi ɛ́ yii gwyes. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, esa e lyak Zɛɛb di edjɛ ɛ belaaa ɛ́ dum nɛ etsi ɔɔ, é di'enek, yɛ aanàkabaadi kɔ ɛsu ɛ ekɛk. Ghuna yɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ ekɛk ee Zɛɛb nasa enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ nɛ Abalaam ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Tin, mɛsa mɛ etsi ɛ́ yé? Etsi nabɛ ɛ́, na ghɛl, étɛp ɛsa náá, mesyem mɛ bot neenyen popoopwon, kɛkum dwoo dha ɛ Abalaam aabyel ɛ, mot ekɛk bak nasael kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɔ. Etsi tak, Zɛɛb nadjɛ yɛ ɛ́, é mɛmbɔ mɛ efofop, tin, efofop ɛboodjɛ yɛ nɛ mot, étɛp nyɛ neekɛgoola yɛ pɛ daa bot. Mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Moiiz. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Ngoola-ngoola di ɛ́ pak bot ɛbá. Tin, é ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nadjɛ ekɛk nɛ Abalaam ɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nyɛ ɛmet, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ngoola-ngoola.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛsɔ mɛ etsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Ye kakwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ náá, etsi nɛ ekɛk e Zɛɛb ààkɛ ze wat é? Ye tok deenek! Yɛ ɛpedi náá, etsi ɛpedjɛ bot tsik'ɔɔ, pe yɛ ɛpesa náá, bot di epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛ etsi. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Tin, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, bot djas ɛ́ si bhel mesyem, etɛɛ náá, ekɛk e Zɛɛb neesael nɛ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Ɛsok nɛ ɛwala ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb kum, mena nadika ɛ́ si bhel etsi, ebwood náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb tak nyen. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />É di'enek, etsi nadi ɛ́ mbaalel yenaka, kɛkum ɛwala ɛ ɛzyɛ ɛ́ Klisto, etɛɛ náá, mena needika bot ɛ epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Dáa ye di mos náá, ɛwala ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb eezekum ɛ, mena tokapɛ si mɛko mɛ dhiiti mbaalel.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas moo ɛ́ bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Tin, biyɔ djas, bot ɛ zeduwa Zɛɛb pɛ tɔ Yezu Klisto ɔ, bi moo ɛ́ dáa Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Tin, ye tokapɛ nɛ mbɛk pak mot mbyak eYuda nɛ mot mbyak eGhɛlɛk, pak kwom mot nɛ mot di ààdi kwom ɔ, pak moma nɛ motom, etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas, bi moo ɛ́ mot ngɔt tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ́ bot ɛ Klisto ɔɔ, deenek bi ɛ́ pe ɛ́ bɛdha ɛ Abalaam, tin, bi ɛ́ waabela esa e lyak ee Zɛɛb nakɛk ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="s">Wɔ tokapɛ kwom, wɔ moo ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Gwakeka sa mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: Dáa ye di náá mɔn lyak dinaa mɔɔ dhyeeb ɛ, nyɛ tok nɛ mbɛk nɛ kwom mot, ye nakoozobɛ náá nyɛy ɛ́ di nakuma esa e lyak. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Tin, nyɛ gwak ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ di ewyel nyɛ ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ di ebaal esa bɛ ɔ, deenek, kɛkum ɛwala ɛ sɛɛg nakwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Tyee wat nɛ menabɛlka djas, é ghɛŋ mena nadika dhatyee bɔɔ dhyeeb ɛ, mena nadika ɛ́ ekwom si bhel embee esisim ee di kɔ bɔs'ak ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Tin, dáa ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb nakoobal ɛ nakadjala ɛ, Zɛɛb naazɛdhis Mɔn'ɛ. Moma ɛ́ nabya mɔn tak, nyɛ nawyelaa ɛ́ si etsi e Moiiz, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />étɛp nyɛ neepɛk bot ɛ nadi si bhel etsi ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ ɛsa náá mena dika bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Deenek, ye neelyaal nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi ɛ́ bɔn bɛ, Zɛɛb eedhis tɔ ebhum elyem binaka Sisim Mɔn'ɛ, Sisim di etuud: «<char style="sc">Abha</char>», ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ Saagam. <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Deenek, wɔ tokapɛ kwom, wɔ moo ɛ́ mɔn, dáa ye di náá, wɔ ɛ́ mɔn'ɛ ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadjɛ wɔ esa e lyak nyɛ nakwom étɛp bɔn bɛ ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛ́ nɛ kɛŋ dum nɛ bot ɛ kyee dik Ghalasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />É sok bi nadi bi dinaa ààgu Zɛɛb ɛ, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ekwom e bɛzɛɛb ɛ di náá, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ bɛ tok bɛtɛtɛ ɛ bɛzɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Nenak, bi eezegu Zɛɛb, nɛghu náá, Zɛɛb eezegu bin. Haaa ye kabaasa dáa, bi baasik si bhel embee esisim ee di kɔ bɔs'ak ɛ, esisim ee di náá, ye tok nɛ mɛtaŋ, ààbɛ nɛ mɛbwala ɛ? Bi baakwyɛl ɛ́, bi baabula si ekwom bɔɔ? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Bi nɛ kwyɛl ɛduwal ɛ mɛlu, nɛ bɛngɔn, nɛ edhiiti mɛwala, baazɛnɔɔ edhiiti membu. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ kɛŋ nɛ nen, etɛɛ náá, mezuk mɛ mɛ nazuk nɛ nen ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛgwyɛ gwyes.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nen, dika dáa mam, etɛɛ náá, mam pe, mɛ moo ɛ́ dáa biyɔ. Bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa mɛ ɛbiyo. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Bi nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, mɛ nagoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal é sok mɛkɛn ɛ, mam ebɛ́. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Dáa bi nabee nyel'am ekpaŋ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa bin bwoo. Bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààbyen mɛ, ààtsin mɛ, tin, bi naamyaal mɛ dáa fofop ɛ Zɛɛb nɛghu dáa Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Deenek, mɛmyaala mɛ bi nadi nɛ yɛ sok ɛ moo wo? Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlɛɛ bin nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, yɛ ɛ́ pe di ɛ́ di esael ɔɔ, pe bi naadis mis men, djɛ mɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Nenak mɛ moo mos ɛ́ mot mɛbhuka men, etɛɛ náá, mɛ nɛ lɛɛ bin etsɛɛtsɛ?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di ewa lyem nɛ nen, bela náá, tɔ ɛwa lyem tak, ye tok nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ. Tin, bɛ saŋ ɛ́ mena bɛkaka, etɛɛ náá bi neewa lyem nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Ɛnyɔ náá, mot wa lyem tɔ embɛɛ esesɛɛ é mɛwala djas. Deenek, sa yɛ ààzodi é sok mɛ di sama wat nɛ nen ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Bɔn bam, mɛ ɛpebaazuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ len dáa mezuk mɛ moma di suula étɛp nyɛ neebya ɛ, kɛkum dwoo Klisto aabe di tɔ len ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />É ɛwala ɛlak, mɛ bɛ ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛdi é di wat nɛ nen, étɛp mɛ neelii dáa di egoka ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ ààgu dáa mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛsa nɛ nen ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aghaad bɛ nɛ Saala ɛ́ ndem mɛbhɛŋ mɛmbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Lɛɛka mɛ, biyɔ bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛdi ɛ́ si etsi ɔ: Bi ààgwak sa etsi di elɛɛ ɛ? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, Abalaam naabya bɔn bɛbá. Ngɔt, nyɛ nabya nyɛ ɛ́ bɛ nɛ Aghaad kwom moma, dhiiti bɛ nɛ Saala moma nadi ààdi kwom ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Tin, mɔn nyɛ nabya bɛ nɛ moma kwom ɔ, nabyel ɛ́ nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ elyem e bot. Yɛ kaabɛ mɔn nyɛ nabya bɛ nɛ moma nadi ààdi kwom ɔ, nyɛ nabyel ɛ́ dáa Zɛɛb nakɛk ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Tin, tɛp'enek ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti ɛsulel ɛ sis, etɛɛ náá, boa binɔk bɛbá lyaal ɛ́ mɛbhɛŋ mɛmbá. Wat ɛ́ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ ɛtsok ɛ Sinayi, bɔn byel penek ɔ, bɛ ɛ́ ekwom: yɛ ɛ́ Aghaad. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Bela náá, Aghaad ɛ́ ɛtsok ɛ Sinayi di pɛ kyee dik Aalabi ɛ. Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́, ghaada Yeluzalɛm di mos'aak. Etɛɛ náá, ghaada Yeluzalɛm nɛ bot djas di tɔ tak ɔ, bɛ ɛ́ tɔ ekwom. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Tin, ghaada Yeluzalɛm di tɔ gwoo ɛ, ye tok tɔ ekwom, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di nyɛɛg'ena. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">«Dia tɔ mɛmyaala, wɔy kwyiid moma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">wɔy moma di ààbya ɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Tsima etsim e mɛmyaala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">wɔy mot di ààgu mɛkpaa mɛ ɛbɛl ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Etɛɛ náá, bɔn ɛ moma zepɛɛaa ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">bɛ ɛpebu dhaa bɔn ɛ moma di é ɛba ɔ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Eza 54.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ, bɔn-nyɛɛg bam ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ bɔn nabyel tɔ ekɛk e Zɛɛb, tyee wat nɛ Izak ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Tin, yɛ ɛ́ dáa ye nadi sok ɛ, mɔn nabyel tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ elyem e bot ɔ, nadi etiig mɔn nabyel dáa Sisim Zɛɛb nalɛɛ ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ dáa ye di esael é dwoo ɛ lak mos ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Tin, Ekwyala lɛɛ dáa? Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá «Sɔa kwom moma nɛ mɔn'ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɔn ɛ kwom moma ààgoka nɛ ɛkaa esa e lyak bɛ nɛ mɔn ɛ moma di ààbɛ kwom ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɔ aabela yɛ ɛ́, tɔ mɛkana mɛ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:9-10">Mɛk 21.9-10</ref></char>.</char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Deenek, bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, mena tokeka bɔn ɛ kwom moma, menaka ɛ́ bɔn ɛ moma di ààdi kwom ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Nàsaabka mɛpɛka mɛ bi nazebela ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Klisto napɛk mena ɛ́, étɛp mena needi ààbaadi ekwom e etsi eYuda. Lyelka bham, yɛ ààgoka náá, bi baabula si bhel ekwom.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Gwakeka, mam Pɔl, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, yɛ bɛ náá, bi eemyaal ɛniigelaa beka ɔɔ, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, Klisto tokapɛ dhiiti vaŋ mot étɛp'en. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Mɛ ɛpebaalɛɛ nɛ bot djas di emyaal náá, bɛ niigal bɛ beka ɔ náá, bɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlooba nɛ etsi djas. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Bi naazebɛka nɛ Klisto, biyɔ bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛsaŋ ɛ náá, bi di bot ɛ epiki é mis ɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛlooba nɛ etsi ɔ. Enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb tokapɛ nɛ nen. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Yɛ kabɛ menabɛlka ɔɔ, mena waka ɛbwaalel ɛ lena ɛ́ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛy mot di esa náá, bot di piki é mis mɛ ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ sa mena di ebwoodka nɛ ghwyil mɛbwala mɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ di enyen tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lena nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Etɛɛ náá, mot ɛ di tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔɔ, ɛni ɛ beka nɛghu ɛdi ààni beka tok nɛ dhiiti mɛtaŋ, tin, sa di nɛ mɛtaŋ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb di enyen tɔ kwyɛl ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bi eekan ɛsum kaab ɛnyɔɛpe! Haaa ɛzɛ kala bin ze, étɛp bi needi ààlooba nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ e Zɛɛb? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Mbi mɛlyo menek ààpadus pɛ daa Zɛɛb, mot nadjóo bin ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Bi ɛ́ kobaka! Ba mɔɔ leviid batsa nɛ sa náá, tsim faalin di esaaa mapa nɛ yɛ ɛ, ghamta. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Dum nɛ Ghɛŋ, mam, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ nen, mɛ nɛ gu náá, bi tok nɛ dhiiti esiiza sis. Deenek, mot di esa ɛzɛm tɔ len ɔ, nyɛ aawaaa é feŋ, ye nakoozodi zɛ.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, bɔn-nyɛɛg, yɛ ɛpedi náá, mɛ ɛpebaagoola bot bhaadal ɛni ɛ́ beka ɔɔ, haaa yɛ ɛ́ kɔ mɛsɔ mɛ yé mɛ baadi etiigaa? É di'enek, ɛgoola bot ɛsyee ɛ Klisto kɔ mɛlaaba aanàbaakpaa bot elyem! <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Tin, bot ɛ di ekus ɛghuub tɔ len ɔ, bɛ gheetetɔ́ nɛ ɛsa embee mɛsa mɔɔ: Bɛ dis bhum ekaad bɔɔ.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛkwosak ɛ Sisim nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ epuud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, bi nadjóoaa ɛ́ étɛp bi needi ààbaadi é ekwom. É di'enek, sa bi ààkasa náá, mɛpɛka mɛ bi zepɛkaa ɛ, di nɛ nen tyee gham étɛp ɛlooba nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ epuud. É di'enek, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi bet náá, kwyɛl djɛɛd bin, étɛp bi neekwyeel pak'en. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Etɛɛ náá, etsi djas ɛ́ sɛɛga tɔ mɛkpa mak: «Ye goka ɛ́ wɔ kwyɛl sɔ'ɔ mot dáa wɔ di ekwyɛl nyel'ɔ met ɛ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Msa 19.18</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛpekwaalel nɛ ɛdyaadel pak'en dáa bɛtit ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ kobaka, bi ɛ́ zɛkɛgónel pak'en.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Tin, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Betka náá, Sisim na Dɛɛ djɛɛd bin, é di'enek, bi aanàkabaasa ɛkwosak ɛ epuud. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Etɛɛ náá, egwyes e epuud ɛ́ nɛ zyaala nɛ egwyes e Sisim. Tin, egwyes e Sisim ɛ́ nɛ zyaala nɛ egwyes e epuud. Deenek, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ zyaala pak'ɔɔ, tyee náá, bi needi ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa sa elyem bin di kwyɛl ɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, Sisim ɛ di edjɛɛd bin ɔɔ, deenek, bi tokapɛ si bhel etsi.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Bela náá, mɛsa mɛ epuud nyen ɛ́ tɔ mɛzɔ, tɔ dɔɔb, tɔ embee mɛfulu, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />tɔ ɛduwal ɛ bɛnaghisɛ, tɔ ɛlyeeb, tɔ mbee lyem, tɔ mɛwɔ, tɔ zok, tɔ ɛbuk, tɔ bhyen ɛdi ɛ́ sama nɛ bɔɔ bɛsɔ, tɔ swaka, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />tɔ embee egwyes, tɔ elangi, tɔ mɛbyoŋ mbɛs zɛnɔɔ edhiiti mesyem di enɔŋel nɛ yenek ɛ. Nenak, mɛ ɛpedul bin mɛlɔ, dáa mɛ nadul bin yɛ sok ɛ: Bot ɛ di esa deenek ɔ, bɛ aanàkwaabela di tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Yɛ kabɛ esa e Sisim na Dɛɛ di edjɛ ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́: mɛkwyɛla, mɛmyaala, egwyem, ɛmaad ɛ lyem, embɛɛ, enɛm esa, nɛ esosoob, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />mɛtela, ɛdil ɛ lyem. Ye tok nɛ tsi wat di ebyen mbi etɛp binek. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Bot ɛ di bot ɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ, naazebem epuud bɔɔ nɛ mɛkwosak mɔɔ, zɛnɔɔ embee egwyes bɔɔ kɔ mɛlaaba.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Dáa ye di náá, tsik'enaka ɛ́ tsik Sisim ɛ, betka náá, mena kɛka tɔ Sisim. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Sa mena ààdika nɛ ɛghɛɛa nyel, djhookatka ebeme pak'enaka, sa mena ààdi nɛ zok pak'enaka.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Bɛpelka mɛkɔm mɛ etɛp pak'en</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, mot ngɔt pak'en ɛ́ zɛbelaaa sa mesyem ɔɔ, biyɔ bot ɛ di nɛ Sisim Zɛɛb ɔ, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbulal nyɛ é ze tɔ egwyem. Bi ɛ́ kobaka, etɛɛ náá, biyɔ bɛmet ɛ́ zɛkɛkwyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Kwyeelka pak'en, da bi ɛ́ bebɛpel mɛkɔm mɛ etɛp bin. Deenek ɛ, bi aakɛ dáa etsi e Klisto di elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Mot di ebun náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot é mis mɛ bot, ghuna nyɛ ààval dhiiti sonok é mis mɛ bot ɔ, nyɛ kɔɔ ɛ́ nyel'ɛ met. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mot nɛ mot pookosiiza mɛsa mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. Nyɛ bee náá, nyɛ ɛpekɛ ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, tin, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛmyaala nɛ nyel'ɛ met, ààbɛ náá, nyɛ kagek yɛ nɛ mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ sis. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Etɛɛ náá, mot nɛ mot goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbɛp mɛkɔm mɛ etɛp bɛ.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Mot di elyoaa Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkaa esa ee nyɛ di nɛ yɛ ɛ, nɛ mot di elyo nyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Sa mot ààkɔɔ nyel'ɛ, bɛ ààsa mɛsɛŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Sa mot aabɛ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ sa nyɛ aabɔ́k ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Mot ɛ bɛ sonok étɛp ɛkwosak ɛ epuud bɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ aabela ɛ́, esa e puud, yɛ ɛ́ ɛsyee. Tin, mot ɛ kabɛ esa e Sisim ɔɔ, nyɛ aabela ɛ́, esa e Sisim, yɛ ɛ́ tsik na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Sa mena ààbula bhis é ɛsa mɛnyɔ nɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, mena aawa zii ɔɔ, mena waabɔ́keka mbɛɛ bhum mɛsa mena, é ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb aakwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Tin, é sok mena di ebela ba mɔɔ ɛpɛɛd ɛ, djhoosaka mɛnyɔ nɛ bot djas, daŋ-daŋ ɛ́ nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bena, bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emwana e mɛsik nɛ mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Beeka, eboo ekyeeb ee mɛ di ekwyal bin nenak'aak, mɛ kwyal yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mbɔ'am met. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛbesal bin náá, bi niigelaa beka ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di saŋ ɛghɛɛa mɛnyel é mis mɛ bot, tɔ ɛsa mɛsa mɛ epuud ɔ. Bɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bɛ di ààtiigaa kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ Klisto é mɛlaaba. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Bot ɛni beka ɔ, bɔɔ bɛmet ààlooba nɛ etsi djas. Bɛ kwyɛl ɛniigal bin beka ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ neediig bet kɔ ɛsu ɛ ndem di é mɛnyel men ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ diig bet ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ Ghɛŋ'ena Yezu Klisto é mɛlaaba. Tin, dum nɛ ɛsyee ɛ Klisto kɔ mɛlaaba, esa e bɔs djas eezegwyɛ é yam mis. Deenek, mam moo ɛ́, mɛ eezegwyɛ dum nɛ esa e bɔs. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Étɛp tak ɛ, ye di náá, ɛni ɛ beka nɛghu ɛdi ààni beka tok nɛ dhiiti mɛtaŋ. Sa di nɛ mɛtaŋ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb djɛ mena tsik na bes. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Dum nɛ bot ɛ di ekɛ tɔ ɛlooba nɛ mɛlyo mak ɔ, beta náá, egwyem nɛ boo lyem ghoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb di nɛ nɔɔ dɔɔ nɛ kɔ Yisalaɛl ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Kana mos, sa mot ààbaawa mɛ tɔ tsik mezuk, etɛɛ náá, endem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">endem </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tɔ lii eGhɛlɛk kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ edho nakuma kwom di ewa kɔ kwom'ɛ, ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ náá, Pɔl ɛ́ mot ɛ Yezu.</char></note> e mezuk mɛ mɛ di nɛ yɛ é nyel'am ɛ, lyaal ɛ́ náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot ɛ Yezu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, betka náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto di tɔ esisim bin. <char style="sc">Amɛn!</char><verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>